[QUEUE: Shift for orders, building and placement. Tap to latch, hold for one.]
	{
	zh-Hans=排队：命令、建造和放置的Shift键。点按锁定，长按单次生效。;
	}

[ADD: Shift for selecting, so taps, boxes and groups add to the selection. Tap to latch, hold for one.]
	{
	zh-Hans=追加：选择时的Shift键，点按、框选和编队都会加入当前选择。点按锁定，长按单次生效。;
	}

[x5: Shift for the build buttons, five at a time. Tap to latch, hold for one.]
	{
	zh-Hans=x5：建造按钮的Shift键，每次5个。点按锁定，长按单次生效。;
	}

[CLEAR: takes back the armed order or the building being placed, else clears the selection.]
	{
	zh-Hans=清除：撤回已启用的命令或正在放置的建筑，否则清除选择。;
	}

[SELECT: selects all units, builders, factories, aircraft, the units on screen, the commander or the same type.]
	{
	zh-Hans=选择：选择所有单位、建造单位、工厂、飞机、屏幕内单位、指挥官或同类型单位。;
	}

[STORE: stores the selection as the lowest free group.]
	{
	zh-Hans=存储：将选中单位存为编号最小的空闲编队。;
	}

[Group: tap to select it, tap again to centre on it, hold to store the selection in it.]
	{
	zh-Hans=编队：点按选择，再次点按居中显示，长按将当前选择存入。;
	}

[PAUSE: pauses or resumes the game.]
